## 3. Cross-cutting concepts

### 3.1 Policy

- Definition stored as data, versioned, validated against a JSON schema.
- Applied by the SSoT, never recomputed in this repo.

### 3.2 Job

- Identity: `jobId`, `kind`, `status` (`queued | running | succeeded | failed | cancelled`).
- Created by every long-running mutation. Followed via polling or stream.

### 3.3 AuditLog

- Append-only on the SSoT.
- Surface in admin UI for sensitive actions only.

